From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.media: CopyFromFileAsync reads tags, default-device events are raised (6514)

SystemMediaTransportControlsDisplayUpdater::CopyFromFileAsync was a
stub. It reads the file's own tags (ID3v2.2-2.4 and ID3v1, MP4 item
lists, FLAC Vorbis comments and pictures, Ogg Vorbis/Opus comments)
into the music, video or image properties and the thumbnail, the file
name standing in for a missing title. MediaDevice kept its
DefaultAudioRender/CaptureDeviceChanged handlers but never raised
them; an IMMNotificationClient now raises them with the new device's
ID and role.
---
