+/*
+ * Stained Glass OS (wine-sg 6514): DefaultAudioRenderDeviceChanged and
+ * DefaultAudioCaptureDeviceChanged are raised. The handlers were kept but nothing raised them,
+ * so a program never learned that the user picked another speaker or microphone. An
+ * IMMNotificationClient registered with mmdevapi when the first handler arrives raises them with
+ * the new device's ID (in the form GetDefaultAudioRenderId gives) and its role.
